sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant ReactComponent as React Component (Frontend)
    participant InertiaClient as Inertia.js Client
    participant LaravelRoute as Laravel Routing / Middleware
    participant Controller as Controller
    participant Service as Business Service
    participant Model as Eloquent Model / Database
    
    User->>ReactComponent: Interacts with UI
    ReactComponent->>InertiaClient: Dispatch Action (e.g., router.post)
    InertiaClient->>LaravelRoute: HTTP Request
    LaravelRoute->>LaravelRoute: Auth & Authorization (Sanctum / Spatie)
    LaravelRoute->>Controller: Route to method
    Controller->>Service: Call Business Logic
    Service->>Model: Read/Write Data
    Model-->>Service: Return Result
    Service-->>Controller: Return Processed Data
    Controller-->>InertiaClient: Inertia::render() / redirect()
    InertiaClient-->>ReactComponent: Update Props / UI State
    ReactComponent-->>User: Visual Update
